+    group on such a cycle waits for itself: one whose member waits for another of its own
+    members, directly or through other bundles, or groups each waiting for the next. The
+    prerequisite edges have no cycle of their own — :func:`check_dep_graph` and
+    :func:`partition_schedulable` see to that first — and a ``Conflicts with`` edge only
